                    {
                        "translation_id": "1b3f54d0-2551-4bf4-8440-ad6d4aafdeeb",
                        "source_entry_id": "38a54307-b5b7-3609-8afa-808367691cda",
                        "source_sense_id": "71e346d0-6766-3da0-8a25-72d7c3a51c2d",
                        "target_lang_word": "sulphite",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sulphite",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "591619ac-d3c2-3c08-b6bc-1fcf5d88bc1b",
                                        "entry_id": "12f1e9d7-942a-3416-be29-6d00cae2505f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of sulfite."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9e8f97d-feae-301a-b17e-acc13afb24ce",
                                        "entry_id": "12f1e9d7-942a-3416-be29-6d00cae2505f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is spontaneous and original in thought and conversation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a87ec314-e4c0-4224-a1eb-ba866a28e129",
                                                "sense_id": "b9e8f97d-feae-301a-b17e-acc13afb24ce",
                                                "text": "A sulphite is a person who does his own thinking, he is a person who has surprises up his sleeve. He is explosive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53ffd2fe-78b4-4e1f-bee8-eedc9c1bdd5b",
                                                "sense_id": "b9e8f97d-feae-301a-b17e-acc13afb24ce",
                                                "text": "Some years ago when the engraving business was just getting a foothold in Chicago and Jones was busily engaged in helping said business gain said foothold, he was known as Charles Engraving Jones. This is a fair sample of his methods. You need not expect anything bromidic from Jones; he is a sulphite."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec1f51b0-059d-4272-8aa4-b447fa55e52c",
                                                "sense_id": "b9e8f97d-feae-301a-b17e-acc13afb24ce",
                                                "text": "\"I don't know,\" Anna answered in the slow tone of one who is weight many things, \"what Ruth will do. She's a sulphite you know.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "458298a0-5691-475b-8403-f21d3b8895c8",
                        "source_entry_id": "38a54307-b5b7-3609-8afa-808367691cda",
                        "source_sense_id": "71e346d0-6766-3da0-8a25-72d7c3a51c2d",
                        "target_lang_word": "sulfite",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sulfite",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3040bc83-95ae-306c-b595-55fddcf72c18",
                                        "entry_id": "f31462c2-4195-3a64-a4f2-e342f5a696ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sel formé par la combinaison de l’acide sulfureux avec une base."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1e3214f-9a01-4559-aba6-878f427cd55d",
                                                "sense_id": "3040bc83-95ae-306c-b595-55fddcf72c18",
                                                "text": "Sulfite de sodium."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "987b33ef-9d5f-3010-8b6b-9b295b6d4cc8",
                                        "entry_id": "f31462c2-4195-3a64-a4f2-e342f5a696ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Conservateur utilisé pour la conservation des vins et divers autres aliments."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ecba9a52-86b9-4c37-835b-9753e13257e0",
                                                "sense_id": "987b33ef-9d5f-3010-8b6b-9b295b6d4cc8",
                                                "text": "Les sulfites (E220 à E228) des vins blancs et rosés, moutarde et certaines crevettes surgelées peuvent entraîner intolérance, allergies, maux de tête, irritations du tube digestif et contrarier la fixation de la vitamine B."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "43d2ad96-e530-460e-b523-757eaf0c6bb2",
                                                "sense_id": "987b33ef-9d5f-3010-8b6b-9b295b6d4cc8",
                                                "text": "Bien pratiques pour éviter les altérations, les sulfites, loués par les scientifiques pour leur efficacité antibactérienne incontestable, ont des effets secondaires moins appréciables. — (« Sulfites : Ça sulfite comme ça », Malbouffe, le dico, Les Dossiers du Canard enchaîné nᵒ 147, avril 2018, page 77)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
